  <header className="border-b border-stone-200 bg-stone-50"><nav aria-label="primary-navigation" className="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl items-center justify-between px-6 py-5"><a href="#top" className="text-xl font-semibold">${brand}</a><div className="flex items-center gap-6"><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#approach">Approach</a><a href="#contact" className="bg-stone-900 px-5 py-3 text-white">Start a conversation</a></div></nav></header>
  <section id="top" aria-label="hero" className="mx-auto grid min-h-[720px] max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-6 py-20 lg:grid-cols-2"><div><p className="mb-5 text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.24em]">${creative.name}</p><h1 className="text-6xl font-semibold leading-[0.95] lg:text-8xl">${offer}</h1><p className="mt-7 max-w-xl text-xl text-stone-600">Created for ${audience}, with clarity, craft, and measurable purpose.</p><a href="#contact" className="mt-9 inline-block bg-orange-700 px-6 py-4 text-white">Explore the opportunity</a></div><img src="${ASSET_CATALOG[0]}" alt="A considered brand experience" data-media-role="hero-foreground" className="h-[620px] w-full object-cover" /></section>
  <section className="border-y border-stone-200 bg-white px-6 py-10"><div className="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-8 md:grid-cols-3"><p className="text-lg">Clear strategic direction</p><p className="text-lg">Distinctive visual execution</p><p className="text-lg">A focused path to action</p></div></section>
  <section id="services" className="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-28"><p className="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">What we do</p><h2 className="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold">A complete experience, shaped around what matters most.</h2><div className="mt-16 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3"><article><p className="text-sm">01</p><h3 className="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold">Understand</h3><p className="mt-3 text-stone-600">We clarify the audience, challenge, and opportunity before making decisions.</p></article><article><p className="text-sm">02</p><h3 className="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold">Create</h3><p className="mt-3 text-stone-600">We turn strategy into a coherent system with a memorable point of view.</p></article><article><p className="text-sm">03</p><h3 className="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold">Deliver</h3><p className="mt-3 text-stone-600">We refine every detail and build a direct path from attention to action.</p></article></div></section>
  <section id="approach" className="bg-stone-900 px-6 py-28 text-white"><div className="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-14 lg:grid-cols-2"><img src="${ASSET_CATALOG[3]}" alt="Detailed and purposeful work" data-media-role="editorial-image" className="h-[560px] w-full object-cover"/><div className="self-center"><p className="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-orange-300">Our approach</p><h2 className="mt-5 text-5xl font-semibold">Designed to feel unmistakably yours.</h2><p className="mt-6 text-lg text-stone-300">Every choice supports the story, strengthens trust, and helps the right audience take the next step.</p></div></div></section>
  <section className="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-28"><div className="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2"><div><p className="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Why it works</p><h2 className="mt-4 text-5xl font-semibold">Less noise. More meaning.</h2></div><div className="space-y-8 text-lg text-stone-600"><p>Strong hierarchy makes complex ideas easier to understand.</p><p>Purposeful imagery creates recognition without relying on decoration.</p><p>Focused calls to action turn interest into a clear next step.</p></div></div></section>
  <section id="contact" className="bg-orange-700 px-6 py-24 text-white"><div className="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col justify-between gap-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-end"><div><p className="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Ready when you are</p><h2 className="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-5xl font-semibold">Let’s create something worth remembering.</h2></div><a href="#contact" className="border border-white px-6 py-4">Start a conversation</a></div></section>
